FETCH_HEAD:tests/cis/Test.CIS.M365.8.4.1.md:5:The test reads the org-wide app settings with `Get-M365UnifiedTenantSettings` (`GlobalApp` for third-party apps and `PrivateApp` for custom apps must be `None`) and `Get-CsTeamsSettingsCustomApp` (`IsSideloadedAppsInteractionEnabled` must be `False`). Microsoft doesn't support `Get-M365UnifiedTenantSettings` with application-based Teams authentication, and the documented Graph teams-app-settings endpoint doesn't support application permissions for these settings. The test skips when the Teams settings cmdlet reports unsupported application authentication; it does not use `Get-MgContext`, which describes the separate Graph session. Run 8.4.1 with delegated Teams authentication.
